  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>Best Project Management Software in 2026</h1>
      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 5+ tools · Business Tools Pillar · Project Management Category</div>

      <p>Project management software is the backbone of how modern teams plan, track, and deliver work. The right tool turns scattered Slack messages and spreadsheet tabs into a single source of truth for tasks, deadlines, and accountability. In 2026, Asana, Monday.com, ClickUp, Notion, and Trello dominate evaluations, but each excels at a different team size, workflow complexity, and budget. We ranked them on onboarding speed, feature depth, automation, pricing, and real-world adoption.</p>
      <p>For head-to-head breakdowns, see <a href="/reviews/clickup-vs-monday/">ClickUp vs Monday.com</a> and <a href="/reviews/monday-vs-asana/">Monday.com vs Asana</a>. Explore the <a href="/reviews/business-tools/">Business Tools Pillar</a> for CRM, email marketing, and document workflow comparisons.</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-overall-asana">#1 — Asana (Best Overall)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-visual-monday">#2 — Monday.com (Best for Visual Workflows)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-allinone-clickup">#3 — ClickUp (Best Feature-Rich All-in-One)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-docs-notion">#4 — Notion (Best for Docs + Projects Unified)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-kanban-trello">#5 — Trello (Best for Kanban Simplicity)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#selection-scenarios">Selection Scenarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buying-guide">Buying Guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <h2 id="quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Tool</th>
            <th>Best For</th>
            <th>Starting Price</th>
            <th>Free Tier</th>
            <th>Rating</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Asana</strong></td>
            <td>Overall, team task management</td>
            <td>$10.99/user/mo (Starter)</td>
            <td>Yes — 10 users</td>
            <td>4.6/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Monday.com</td>
            <td>Visual workflows, cross-team</td>
            <td>$9/user/mo (Basic)</td>
            <td>14-day trial</td>
            <td>4.5/5</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
